OL,3,GNEWSABanks refund victims of fake
OL,4,Afuneral plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost #35,000 has been refunded to
OL,7,Fvictims who were sold fake funeral
OL,8,Fplans by Hull undertaker Robert Bush,
OL,9,Fan MP said.
OL,11,FBush was sentenced to 20 years in
OL,12,Fprison in July for denying 30 people a
OL,13,Fdecent and proper burial, theft, and
OL,14,Ffraudulent trading, including selling
OL,15,Ffake funeral policies. He defrauded
OL,16,Fnearly 200 families out of #562,117,
OL,17,FHull Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
