OL,3,GNEWSABanks refund victims of fake
OL,4,Afuneral plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Hardy MP, who campaigned for banks
OL,7,Fto refund victims, said many had
OL,8,Fsuffered significant distress after
OL,9,Fspending their life savings on fake
OL,10,Fpolicies.
OL,12,FShe said Barclays, Lloyds, Santander,
OL,13,FNatwest, Nationwide and Virgin had made
OL,14,Fgoodwill refunds to their customers,
OL,15,Fwhich she hoped would provide "at least
OL,16,Fsome measure of justice".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
